        {
          "text": " ("
        },
        {
          "text": "Bb",
          "marks": [
            "code",
            {
              "type": "color",
              "tone": "rose"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ") — tinted rose here, and outlined rose wherever the neck draws it. The chip that lights on the scale card below is amber, though: the app tints every difference amber, whatever hue the scale itself carries."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "live",
      "component": "scale-compare",
