    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Start the drone, then play both runs from the bottom, one after the other. The "
        },
        {
          "text": "second",
          "marks": ["bold"]
        },
        {
          "text": " note is where they part — a whole step from home on the "
        },
        {
          "text": "A Natural minor",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " card, one fret from home on the "
        },
        {
          "text": "A Phrygian",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " card. The first step you take away from home is the whole mode."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A half step sitting directly above the tonic is the strongest single darkening move available in the whole set — "
        },
        {
          "text": "Where the Half Steps Fall",
          "link": {
            "kind": "article",
            "slug": "modes-half-steps"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " already counted exactly which two of the seven modes have one, and Phrygian is one of them. Here's the sharper fact, and it's this chapter's to say: of the five modes that carry a characteristic note, the "
        },
        {
          "text": "b2",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " is the only one that sits a half step from home. Lydian's "
        },
        {
          "text": "#4",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " is six semitones off, Mixolydian's "
        },
        {
          "text": "b7",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " is two, Dorian's "
        },
        {
          "text": "6",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " is three, and the one mode this pathway hasn't reached yet is six as well. Nothing else in the set leans on home this hard."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Phrygian also carries two avoid notes, not one — the "
        },
        {
          "text": "b2",
          "marks": [
            "code",
            {
              "type": "color",
              "tone": "rose"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ("
        },
        {
          "text": "Bb",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ") sits a half step above the root itself, and the "
        },
        {
          "text": "b6",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " ("
        },
        {
          "text": "F",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ") still sits a half step above the "
        },
        {
          "text": "5",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " — the ache Phrygian never lost. "
        },
        {
          "text": "The Ache Above the Fifth",
          "link": {
            "kind": "article",
            "slug": "modes-the-ache"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " already did the arithmetic for that second one; it's the only mode of the six across both families that carries two."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Its tritone falls between the "
        },
        {
          "text": "b2",
          "marks": [
            "code",
            {
              "type": "color",
              "tone": "rose"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and the "
        },
        {
          "text": "5",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " — "
        },
        {
          "text": "Bb",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "text": "E",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " — and it touches the "
        },
        {
          "text": "5",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Chapter 2 gave the address; "
        },
        {
          "text": "Where the Tritone Lands",
          "link": {
            "kind": "article",
            "slug": "modes-the-tritone"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The vamp is "
        },
        {
          "text": "Am",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": "–"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bb",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ", a "
        },
        {
          "text": "i",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": "–"
        },
        {
          "text": "bII",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ". "
        },
        {
          "text": "Bb",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " is "
        },
        {
          "text": "Bb D F",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Bb",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " in it is the "
        },
        {
          "text": "b2",
          "marks": [
            "code",
            {
              "type": "color",
              "tone": "rose"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". It's two chords unlike anything else you've played in this pathway."
